  "Correct Answer": "C",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "Homothetic figures are similar figures, and the homothety ratio is the similarity ratio. The area ratio is the square of the similarity ratio: \\(1:4\\).",
